commit ff7ce121
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 17:16:29 -0600
subject: feat(usage): add Trae entitlement quota support (trae usage handler)

- open-sse/services/usage/trae.js: getTraeUsage() mirroring zed/xiaomi-mimo
  handler convention; entitlement-based quota from cockpit-tools reference
  (jlcodes99). Quota rows from ide_user_ent_usage + ide_user_pay_status.
  Region-aware origins: growsg-normal.trae.ai / grow-normal.trae.ai /
  grow-normal.traeapi.us / api.trae.cn (CN v2 paths). Plan from
  user_pay_identity_str; unlimited when entitlement unlimited.
- open-sse/services/usage.js: register trae in USAGE_HANDLERS.
- tests/unit/trae-usage.test.js: 13 vitest cases (region mapping, quota
  parsing, error handling, auth header).
- ProviderLimits/utils.js: parseQuotaData trae case (remainingPercentage
  + unlimited forwarding).


